{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774486860529,"story":{"title":"Sparky's Great Big Wonder","userPrompt":"A brave little dragon","authorStyleId":"maurice-sendak","readingLevel":"fluent","illustrationStyleId":"storybook_classic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Sparky was a small dragon, quite small. His scales were the color of ripe berries. He lived in a cave near Whispering Woods, but he wasn't like the other dragons. They liked naps and stacks of rocks. Sparky liked maps! He longed to know what lands were far, far away. He yearned to learn all there was to know. His heart was full of wonder.","illustrationPrompt":"Whimsical children's book illustration of Sparky, a small, bright berry-colored dragon, gazing at a large, open map. He has big, curious eyes. The cave is cozy but cluttered with maps and scrolls. Warm colors like red, orange, and yellow dominate. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774234825717,"durationMs":5581,"retries":0,"promptLength":646,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with yearning, curious expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. Sparky sitting in his cave, surrounded by maps. He looks longingly towards the distance. in Sparky's cave near Whispering Woods. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, Sparky found a very old map. It showed a place called Glimmer Glen. The glen was said to hold secrets and songs. No dragon had been there, not ever! Sparky felt a tingle in his toes. He packed a bag with berries and bread. He grabbed his favorite blue blanket. He knew he had to go, to see what he could see.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky packing a small bag with berries and bread. He's also wrapping himself in a bright blue blanket. He has a determined but slightly nervous expression. The background shows the cave entrance with Whispering Woods visible outside. Use bright, cheerful colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774234825209,"durationMs":5072,"retries":0,"promptLength":644,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with excited, determined expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. Sparky packing a bag, holding a map of Glimmer Glen. He has a determined expression. in Sparky's cave near Whispering Woods. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"The Whispering Woods lived up to its name. Trees rustled secrets in the breeze. Sparky walked past tall ferns and funny mushrooms. He saw a squirrel with stripy socks. He heard a frog play a flute of reeds. Every step was a brand new song. The world was big and bold and bright.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky walking through Whispering Woods. The trees are tall and whimsical with funny faces on their trunks. A squirrel with stripy socks peeks out from behind a tree. A frog plays a flute made of reeds. Use a palette of greens, browns, and pops of color. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774234826028,"durationMs":5891,"retries":0,"promptLength":649,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with amazed, curious expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. Sparky walking through the Whispering Woods, observing the surroundings. A squirrel with stripy socks is nearby. in Whispering Woods. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"He met a badger with a backpack. The badger's name was Barnaby. Barnaby was going to Glimmer Glen too! He said the glen was full of light. He said the glen was full of friends. Sparky felt a leap of joy inside. Two friends were better than one, he knew. They walked along, side by side.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky and Barnaby the badger walking side-by-side on a path. Barnaby wears a small backpack. Both have friendly, happy expressions. The forest path stretches ahead of them. Use warm, inviting colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774234831843,"durationMs":6633,"retries":0,"promptLength":1038,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with joyful, friendly expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with friendly, optimistic expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. Sparky meeting Barnaby the badger, who is wearing a backpack. They are smiling at each other. in Whispering Woods. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"They came to a river, wide and swift. Barnaby looked worried and weak. Sparky puffed out his chest with pride. \"I can fly us both,\" he said. Barnaby climbed onto Sparky's back. Sparky beat his small wings with glee. They soared above the trees so high. They felt the wind beneath their feet.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky flying over a wide river with Barnaby on his back. They both have expressions of joy and excitement. The river flows below, and the trees look small from above. Use bright blue and green colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1774235421084,"durationMs":19,"retries":0,"promptLength":1065,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with proud, excited expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with slightly worried, trusting expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. Sparky flying Barnaby across a wide river. Barnaby is holding on tight. in River near Whispering Woods. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"At last, they saw it: Glimmer Glen. It sparkled like a thousand stars! Little lights danced in the air. Tiny flutes played happy tunes. Flowers bloomed in every color. Sparky and Barnaby landed with a thump. They had found the end of their quest!","illustrationPrompt":"A panoramic view of Glimmer Glen, sparkling with light. Tiny, fairy-like figures are dancing in the air. Flowers of every color bloom around them. Sparky and Barnaby stand in the foreground, looking amazed. Use a palette of shimmering colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1774235383690,"durationMs":716,"retries":0,"promptLength":1057,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with amazed, awestruck expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with amazed, awestruck expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. Sparky and Barnaby landing in Glimmer Glen, looking at the magical scenery with awe. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"A small elf with mossy shoes ran up. \"Welcome, friends!\" she said with a smile. \"We've been waiting just for you.\" She led them to a table grand and great. There were cakes and jams and jellies bright. There was juice of every single shade. Sparky and Barnaby felt so at home.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky and Barnaby being greeted by a small elf with mossy shoes. She has a warm, welcoming smile. A table laden with colorful cakes, jams, and jellies is in the background. Use warm, inviting colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1774235392807,"durationMs":548,"retries":0,"promptLength":1464,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with happy, welcomed expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with happy, welcomed expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. A small pale freckled skin magical creature, big-expressive bright green eyes with welcoming, friendly expression, wearing A dress made of woven leaves and moss, adorned with tiny glowing mushrooms., with mossy shoes and flower crown, pointed ears adorned with small silver rings, a warm and radiant smile, a scattering of freckles across her nose, always carries a small, glowing lantern, slim build. An elf leader welcoming Sparky and Barnaby to Glimmer Glen. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 2, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"They ate and laughed and sang with glee. They told their tales of woods and streams. The elves shared songs of stars and moon. Sparky learned a song of growing things. Barnaby learned a dance of happy feet. The glen was full of kindness pure.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky, Barnaby, and the elves singing and laughing around the table. They all have joyful expressions. The scene is filled with light and warmth. Use bright, cheerful colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774234837352,"durationMs":5683,"retries":0,"promptLength":1402,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with joyful, happy expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with joyful, happy expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. A small pale freckled skin magical creature, big-expressive bright green eyes with joyful, happy expression, wearing A dress made of woven leaves and moss, adorned with tiny glowing mushrooms., with mossy shoes and flower crown, pointed ears adorned with small silver rings, a warm and radiant smile, a scattering of freckles across her nose, always carries a small, glowing lantern, slim build. Sparky and Barnaby eating, laughing, and singing with the elves at a table. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"But then a grumpy gnome stomped in. His face was long, his voice was gruff. \"No songs!\" he growled. \"No happy tunes!\" He said the glen was much too loud. He said the glen was much too bright. He wanted quiet, peace, and gloom.","illustrationPrompt":"A grumpy gnome stomping into the scene. He has a long face and a frowning expression. The other characters look surprised and slightly worried. Use darker, muted colors for the gnome. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1774235414175,"durationMs":12,"retries":0,"promptLength":690,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small tan, wrinkled skin magical creature, small dull grey eyes with angry, grumpy expression, wearing A tattered brown coat, a dark grey cap, and muddy boots., with a small, cracked pipe, a long, hooked nose, bushy eyebrows that furrow downwards, a permanent scowl on his face, always carrying a gnarled walking stick, stocky build. A grumpy gnome stomping into Glimmer Glen, looking angry and disapproving. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"Sparky looked at the gnome with care. He saw a sadness in his eyes. \"Perhaps,\" said Sparky, soft and low, \"you need a friend to sing with you.\" He offered the gnome a berry tart. The gnome took a bite and smiled just a bit. The music started once again.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky offering a berry tart to the grumpy gnome. The gnome is hesitantly taking a bite and starting to smile. The other characters are watching with hopeful expressions. Use warm, inviting colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1774235398959,"durationMs":424,"retries":0,"promptLength":987,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with compassionate, kind expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A small tan, wrinkled skin magical creature, small dull grey eyes with hesitant, suspicious expression, wearing A tattered brown coat, a dark grey cap, and muddy boots., with a small, cracked pipe, a long, hooked nose, bushy eyebrows that furrow downwards, a permanent scowl on his face, always carrying a gnarled walking stick, stocky build. Sparky offering a berry tart to the grumpy gnome, speaking to him gently. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":11,"text":"The gnome began to hum along. He sang a song of dusty caves. The elves and friends joined in with joy. Soon, the gnome was laughing loud. He danced and spun and felt so free. He was happy in Glimmer Glen at last. He finally found what he craved.","illustrationPrompt":"The gnome singing and dancing with the other characters. He has a happy, joyful expression. The scene is filled with music and laughter. Use bright, cheerful colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"none","generatedAt":1774235402556,"durationMs":12,"retries":0,"promptLength":1838,"success":false,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with happy, content expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with happy, content expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. A small pale freckled skin magical creature, big-expressive bright green eyes with happy, content expression, wearing A dress made of woven leaves and moss, adorned with tiny glowing mushrooms., with mossy shoes and flower crown, pointed ears adorned with small silver rings, a warm and radiant smile, a scattering of freckles across her nose, always carries a small, glowing lantern, slim build. A small tan, wrinkled skin magical creature, small dull grey eyes with joyful, happy expression, wearing A tattered brown coat, a dark grey cap, and muddy boots., with a small, cracked pipe, a long, hooked nose, bushy eyebrows that furrow downwards, a permanent scowl on his face, always carrying a gnarled walking stick, stocky build. The grumpy gnome singing and dancing with the elves and Sparky and Barnaby. He is now smiling and happy. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition] [variation 3, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":12,"text":"Sparky smiled. He learned that day, that wonder wasn't just to see. It was to share with every soul. He learned that kindness is the key. He and Barnaby hugged their friends. They said goodbye with happy tears. They knew they'd visit Glimmer Glen. Their hearts were full of cheer and glee.","illustrationPrompt":"Sparky and Barnaby hugging the elves and the gnome. Everyone has happy, smiling faces. Glimmer Glen sparkles in the background. The scene is filled with warmth and love. Use bright, cheerful colors. Style: cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774234842416,"durationMs":5060,"retries":0,"promptLength":1749,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small ripe berry red scales with a light pink belly dragon, big-expressive bright golden yellow eyes with happy, grateful expression, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of pink, a single, adorable gap-toothed smile, tiny, shimmering wings, a slightly oversized tail that wags enthusiastically, chubby build. A medium fluffy grey fur with a distinctive black and white striped face badger, average warm honey brown eyes with happy, grateful expression, wearing A brown canvas backpack with patches, a green vest with wooden buttons, and brown trousers., with round spectacles, a small, neatly trimmed mustache, a slightly crooked smile, a patch over his left eye, always carries a walking stick, average build. A small pale freckled skin magical creature, big-expressive bright green eyes with happy, grateful expression, wearing A dress made of woven leaves and moss, adorned with tiny glowing mushrooms., with mossy shoes and flower crown, pointed ears adorned with small silver rings, a warm and radiant smile, a scattering of freckles across her nose, always carries a small, glowing lantern, slim build. A small tan, wrinkled skin magical creature, small dull grey eyes with happy, grateful expression, wearing A tattered brown coat, a dark grey cap, and muddy boots., with a small, cracked pipe, a long, hooked nose, bushy eyebrows that furrow downwards, a permanent scowl on his face, always carrying a gnarled walking stick, stocky build. Sparky and Barnaby hugging their new friends, preparing to leave Glimmer Glen. in Glimmer Glen. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.0-flash","imageProv